     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Specific tx: surfactant — intratracheal via ETT, or less-invasive (LISA) via a small tracheal catheter. Surfactant hastens recovery and ↓pneumothorax, IVH, BPD and neonatal mortality."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
